          "targets": "1 or 2 creatures",
          "save": "Basic reflex",
          "description": "<p>An arc of lightning leaps from one target to another. Each target takes 2d4 electricity damage with a basic Reflex save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>",
          "cast": false,
